{
  "description": "What a scene's settings form draws, read the same way by every client that draws one: the shared SPA (frontend/src/utils/refreshInterval.ts sceneStateFields: the scene's fields plus the implicit 'Refresh interval (seconds)' field; frontend/src/utils/showIf.ts visiblePublicStateFields: the public fields whose showIf passes against the defaults overlaid with `values`, later maps winning) and the iOS app (ios/FrameOSKit/Sources/FrameOSKit/Contracts/SceneFields.swift, SceneForm.stateFields / visiblePublicFields). `expect.fields` is every state field (name, label, type, value, access, role), `expect.visible` the names the form shows, in order. Replayed by cloud/apps/auth-web/src/test/shared-spa/scene-form-fixtures.test.ts and ios/FrameOSKit/Tests/FrameOSKitTests/SceneFormFixtureTests.swift; the runtime's own copy of the refresh-interval rule is frameos/src/frameos/refresh_interval.nim.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "no fields: the implicit refresh interval from settings",
      "scene": {
        "id": "a",
        "settings": {
          "refreshInterval": 60
        }
      },
      "values": [],
      "expect": {
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "refreshInterval",
            "label": "Refresh interval (seconds)",
            "type": "float",
            "value": "60",
            "access": "public",
            "role": "refreshInterval"
          }
        ],
        "visible": [
          "refreshInterval"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "no fields, no settings: 300 seconds",
      "scene": {
        "id": "a"
      },
      "values": [],
      "expect": {
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "refreshInterval",
            "label": "Refresh interval (seconds)",
            "type": "float",
            "value": "300",
            "access": "public",
            "role": "refreshInterval"
          }
        ],
        "visible": [
          "refreshInterval"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a numeric refreshInterval field takes the role",
      "scene": {
        "id": "a",
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "city",
            "type": "string",
            "access": "public",
            "value": "Tallinn"
          },
          {
            "name": "refreshInterval",
            "type": "integer",
            "access": "public",
            "value": "120"
          }
        ]
      },
      "values": [],
      "expect": {
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "city",
            "label": null,
            "type": "string",
            "value": "Tallinn",
            "access": "public",
            "role": null
          },
          {
            "name": "refreshInterval",
            "label": null,
            "type": "integer",
            "value": "120",
            "access": "public",
            "role": "refreshInterval"
          }
        ],
        "visible": [
          "city",
          "refreshInterval"
        ]
      }
    },
